        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Rectangular piece; one corner curved.  Plain cotton ground, printed with wood blocks in black, crimson and purplish-pink.  Design shows Chinese woman, man and child in a boat; a pagoda and palm tree in the background. Butterflies, birds and floral sprays fill the interspaces.  Condition good."@en ;
